<title>JAPAN: S.Korea development bank launches samurai bonds.</title>
<headline>S.Korea development bank launches samurai bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Development Bank (KDB) on Monday launched 30 billion yen worth of 2.45 percent samurai bonds due on September 10, 2001, lead-manager Nomura Securities Co Ltd said.</p>
</text>
